{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQcdFramingCp","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQcdFramingCp","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.cpEven_qpow_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.cpEven_qpow_iff","kind":"theorem","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L217-L234","doc":"**CP-evenness of `Θ = qⁿ` is exactly `q^{2n} = 1`.** Combined with\n`framingPhase_eq_pm_one`, this says: the writhe framing phase is\nCP-even iff `q^{2n}=1`, and then `Θ = ±1`. At a real substrate\n`q₀ > 0, q₀ ≠ 1`, `q₀^{2n}=1 ⟺ n = 0 ⟹ Θ = 1 ⟹ θ = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.bar_qpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.bar_qpow","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L210-L215","doc":"Auxiliary: `bar (qⁿ) = (qⁿ)⁻¹`, the pure-phase identity unpacked. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.purePhase_qpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.purePhase_qpow","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L199-L208","doc":"A `q`-power framing phase is automatically a **pure phase**, given\nonly that `bar q = q⁻¹` (the defining action of bar on the substrate\nparameter). Uses `bar (qⁿ) = (bar q)ⁿ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.theta_qcd_in_zero_pi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.theta_qcd_in_zero_pi","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L166-L182","doc":"**Conditional result (§3b-cond).** *If* the colour sector is CP-even\n(`ColorSectorCPEven R`), *then* the strong-CP framing angle is real:\n`Θ ∈ {0, π}` (i.e. `Θ = 1 ∨ Θ = -1`).\n\nFully proved from the class hypotheses via `framingPhase_eq_pm_one`;\nthe only unproved input is the class instance itself (the open\nconjecture). The conclusion `Θ = ±1` is NOT a class field — the class\ncarries the *hypotheses* (pure + CP-even) and this theorem *derives* a\ndistinct conclusion, so it is a non-degenerate conditional, not a\nself-assuming projection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framing_cp_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framing_cp_even","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L164-L164","doc":"**OPEN**: `Θ` is CP-even. The colour-singlet writhe cancellation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framing_pure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framing_pure","kind":"theorem","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L162-L162","doc":"Derived: `Θ` is a pure phase (`bar Θ = Θ⁻¹`) — keystone result. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framing_nonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framing_nonzero","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L160-L160","doc":"`Θ ≠ 0` (a phase is invertible). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framingPhase","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.framingPhase","kind":"def","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L158-L158","doc":"The colour-sector total framing phase `Θ = q^{Σ w·c}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven.mk","kind":"ctor","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L156-L156","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.ColorSectorCPEven","kind":"class","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L144-L164","doc":"**CONJECTURE (open, no instance).** The QCD colour-sector total\nframing phase `framingPhase` is a pure phase that is *additionally*\nCP-even (bar-symmetric).\n\n- `framing_nonzero`, `framing_pure` : it is a unit-modulus phase\n  (the derived/keystone part — automatic for a `q`-power).\n- `framing_cp_even` : it is CP-even — **this is the OPEN content**,\n  the colour-singlet writhe-cancellation over the three tubes.\n\nNo `instance : ColorSectorCPEven R` is (or may be) supplied without a\ngenuine derivation: an axiom asserting `θ = 0` is NOT a derivation\n(AGENTS.md, Anti-Laundering). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.framingPhase_eq_pm_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.framingPhase_eq_pm_one","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L115-L128","doc":"**`θ ∈ {0, π}`.** A CP-even pure phase is `+1` or `-1`.\n\nThis is the full \"CP symmetry of the colour framing sector ⟹ the\nstrong-CP framing angle is real ⟹ `θ ∈ {0, π}`\" implication,\nverified over any field. It does NOT assert that the colour sector\n*is* CP-even (that is the open `ColorSectorCPEven` conjecture), nor\nthat `θ` is *small* (a discrete `{0,π}` value is not `<10⁻¹⁰`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.framingPhase_sq_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.framingPhase_sq_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L101-L113","doc":"**Reality step (algebraic).** A CP-even pure phase satisfies `Θ² = 1`.\n\nRead physically: `bar Θ = Θ⁻¹` (pure phase) and `bar Θ = Θ` (CP-even)\ngive `Θ⁻¹ = Θ`, whence `Θ · Θ = Θ · Θ⁻¹ = 1`. This is\n\"bar-symmetry ⟹ the phase is real\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.IsPurePhase","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.IsPurePhase","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L87-L94","doc":"`x` is a **pure phase**: its bar is its inverse (`x · x̄ = 1`,\nunit modulus). For a `q`-power `Θ = qᵏ` this is automatic, since\n`bar (qᵏ) = q⁻ᵏ = Θ⁻¹`. Physically: the keystone \"framing-is-phase\"\nresult, `|Θ| = 1` on the substrate circle. (Requires `Inv`, so it is\nstated over a `Field`; `BarInvolution` needs only the `CommRing`\nthat every `Field` provides.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.IsCPEven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.IsCPEven","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L83-L85","doc":"`x` is **CP-even** (bar-symmetric): its own charge conjugate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_one","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_mul","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L78-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_add","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L77-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L76-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.bar","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L75-L75","doc":"The bar map `x ↦ x̄`. On the fibre circle this is complex conjugation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution.mk","kind":"ctor","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ThetaQCDFraming.BarInvolution","kind":"class","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ThetaQcdFramingCp.lean#L73-L79","signatureChunk":0}]}